        </li>\n          </ul>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n\n\n  \n</header>\n<!-- nist-index-ignore-end -->\n</div>\n  \n  <div class="grid-container">\n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n    \n\n<div\n   id="block-nist-www-content" class="nist-block"\n>\n  \n    \n      \n\n\n\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\n        \n<section\n       class="nist-page__content usa-section clearfix"\n    >\n\n  <a id="main-content" tabindex="-1"></a>\n\n    <div class="nist-section-header  nist-section-header--menu">\n                    <div class="nist-section-header__top grid-container">\n                      \n<a href="/itl">Information Technology Laboratory</a>\n\n\n          </div>\n      <div class="nist-section-header__sub">\n                <div class="nist-section-header__main grid-container">\n                  <div class="grid-row">\n          <div class="nist-section-header__title">\n                  \n    <h1 class="nist-page__title">AI Risk Management Framework</h1>\n\n\n              </div>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n      \n  <div class="grid-container margin-top-4">\n    <div class="grid-row grid-gap-4">\n\n                  <aside class="nist-page__region nist-page__region--sidebar-first tablet-lg:grid-col-4 desktop-lg:grid-col-3">\n        <div>\n          <!-- nist-index-ignore-start -->\n<div\n   data-elastic-exclude="" class="nist-block"\n>\n  \n    \n      \n\n  <nav>\n    <ul class="usa-sidenav usa-accordion ">\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/ai-rmf-development" data-drupal-link-system-path="">AI RMF Development</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/nist-ai-rmf-playbook" data-drupal-link-system-path="">NIST AI RMF Playbook</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/programs-projects/concept-note-ai-rmf-profile-trustworthy-ai-critical-infrastructure" data-drupal-link-system-path="">AI RMF Critical Infrastructure Profile</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/ai-risk-management-framework-engage" data-drupal-link-system-path="">Engage</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/ai-risk-management-framework-resources" data-drupal-link-system-path="">Resources</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/perspectives-about-nist-artificial-intelligence-risk-management" data-drupal-link-system-path="">Perspectives</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/ai-risk-management-framework-faqs" data-drupal-link-system-path="">FAQs</a>\n              </li>\n          <li class="usa-sidenav__item">\n        <a href="/artificial-intelligence" data-drupal-link-system-path="">AI @ NIST</a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n\n        \n  </div>\n<!-- nist-index-ignore-end -->\n\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n            \n            \n            <div\n               class="nist-page__region nist-page__region--content tablet-lg:grid-col-8 desktop-lg:grid-col-9"\n            >\n        \n<div\n   class="nist-block"\n>\n  \n    \n        \n  <div class="nist-content-row nist-content-row--width-legible paragraph paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default">\n          <div class="nist-block text-long"><div class="nist-callout"><p>On April 7, 2026, NIST released a concept note for an <strong>AI RMF Profile on Trustworthy AI in Critical Infrastructure</strong>. The profile will guide critical infrastructure operators towards specific risk management practices to consider when engaging AI-enabled capabilities. <a href="/programs-projects/concept-note-ai-rmf-profile-trustworthy-ai-critical-infrastructure" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f419d523-f561-490f-a486-1c90ca17d752" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Concept Note: AI RMF Profile on Trustworthy AI in Critical Infrastructure">Learn more</a>.&nbsp;</p></div><h2>Quick Links&nbsp;</h2><p><a class="usa-button webform-dialog webform-dialog-narrow" href="https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.100-1.pdf">Download the AI RMF 1.0</a> <a class="usa-button webform-dialog webform-dialog-narrow" href="https://airc.nist.gov/airmf-resources/playbook/">View the AI RMF Playbook</a> <a class="usa-button webform-dialog webform-dialog-narrow" href="https://airc.nist.gov/">Visit the AI Resource Center</a></p><h2>Overview of the AI RMF&nbsp;</h2><p><span>Led by the Information Technology Laboratory (ITL) AI Program, and in collaboration with the private and public sectors, NIST has developed a framework to better manage risks to individuals, organizations, and society associated with artificial intelligence (AI). The </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.6028/NIST.AI.100-1"><span>NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF)</span></a><span> is intended for voluntary use and to improve the ability to incorporate trustworthiness considerations into the design, development, use, and evaluation of AI products, services, and systems.</span></p><p><span>Released on January 26, 2023, the Framework was developed through a consensus-driven, open, transparent, and collaborative process that included a Request for Information, several draft versions for public comments, multiple </span><a href="/artificial-intelligence/itl-ai-engagement" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ccb6878b-c0ef-4c93-8619-feca42a1eda9" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="ITL AI Engagement "><span>workshops</span></a><span>, and other opportunities to provide input. It is intended to build on, align with, and support AI risk management efforts by others (</span><a class="media-link-ga " data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="dde8d070-49e2-490d-9dc5-95527ee61c79" data-file-url="/system/files/documents/2024/10/07/09-24-about-the-ai-rmf-for-distro-9-25_508-edit.pdf" href="/document/about-nist-ai-rmf" title="About the NIST AI RMF"><span>Fact Sheet</span></a><span>).</span></p><p><span>A companion </span><a href="https://airc.nist.gov/AI_RMF_Knowledge_Base/Playbook"><span>NIST AI RMF Playbook</span></a><span>&nbsp;also has been published by NIST </span>along with&nbsp;an <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/roadmap-nist-artificial-intelligence-risk-management-framework-ai" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="2c916baf-3869-45d0-a2c2-ee8654efa876" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Roadmap for the NIST Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework (AI RMF 1.0) ">AI RMF Roadmap</a>,&nbsp;<a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/crosswalks-nist-artificial-intelligence-risk-management-framework" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="d1ce3169-dbc4-40bd-96db-ab879e89aeb4" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Crosswalks to the NIST Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework (AI RMF 1.0) ">AI RMF Crosswalk</a>,&nbsp;and various <a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/perspectives-about-nist-artificial-intelligence-risk-management" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="e8b03970-7167-4f35-ae63-0b18475055ad" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Perspectives about the NIST Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework">Perspectives</a>.</p><p>On March 30, 2023, NIST launched the <a href="https://airc.nist.gov/Home">Trustworthy and Responsible AI Resource Center</a>, which will facilitate implementation of, and international alignment with, the AI RMF. <span>Examples of how other organizations are building on and using the AI RMF can be found via the </span><a href="https://airc.nist.gov/Usecases"><span>AIRC’s Use Case page</span></a><span>.</span></p><p><span>On July 26, 2024, NIST released&nbsp;</span><a href="https://doi.org/10.6028/NIST.AI.600-1"><span>NIST-AI-</span><em><span>600-1, Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework: Generative Artificial Intelligence Profile</span></em></a><span>. The profile &nbsp;can help organizations identify unique risks posed by generative AI and&nbsp;proposes&nbsp;actions for generative AI risk management that best aligns with their goals and priorities.</span></p><p><span>On April 7, 2026, NIST released a </span><a href="/programs-projects/concept-note-ai-rmf-profile-trustworthy-ai-critical-infrastructure" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f419d523-f561-490f-a486-1c90ca17d752" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Concept Note: AI RMF Profile on Trustworthy AI in Critical Infrastructure"><span>concept note for an AI RMF Profile on Trustworthy AI in Critical Infrastructure</span></a><span>. The profile will guide critical infrastructure operators towards specific risk management practices to consider when engaging AI-enabled capabilities.&nbsp;</span></p><p>To view public comments received on the previous drafts of the AI RMF and Requests for Information, see&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/ai-rmf-development" title="https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/ai-rmf-development" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="eddb1b58-bdfa-416c-bb3c-01c78227967c" data-entity-substitution="canonical">AI RMF Development</a>&nbsp;page.</p><h2><a class="ck-anchor" id="\\translation">Translations&nbsp;</a></h2><ul><li><a href="https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.100-1.ara.pdf">NIST AI Risk Management Framework</a> (Arabic)</li><li><a href="https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/NIST.AI.100-1.jpn.pdf">NIST AI Risk Management Framework </a>(Japanese)</li></ul><h2><strong>Prior Documents</strong></h2><ul><li><a class="media-link-ga " data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="66574bdc-5a28-48fe-846b-fd60d2f83fec" data-file-url="/system/files/documents/2022/08/18/AI_RMF_2nd_draft.pdf" href="/document/ai-risk-management-framework-2nd-draft" title="AI Risk Management Framework 2nd Draft"><span>Second draft of the AI Risk Management Framework</span></a><span> (August 18, 2022)</span></li><li><a class="media-link-ga " data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="d53ff9d0-89c8-4294-9377-f121f8c7999e" data-file-url="/system/files/documents/2022/03/17/AI-RMF-1stdraft.pdf" href="/document/ai-risk-management-framework-initial-draft" title="AI Risk Management Framework: Initial Draft">Initial draft of the AI Risk Management Framework</a>&nbsp;(March 17, 2022)</li><li><a class="media-link-ga " data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="0afe0731-58fa-459a-b587-ff5d326cdb1f" data-file-url="/system/files/documents/2021/12/14/AI%20RMF%20Concept%20Paper_13Dec2021_posted.pdf" href="/document/airmfconceptpaper" title="AI_RMF_ConceptPaper">Concept paper to help guide development of the AI Risk Management Framework</a>&nbsp;(December 13, 2021)</li><li><a class="media-link-ga " data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="0a9fedcc-1283-4893-b2ae-7389bf30a413" data-file-url="/system/files/documents/2021/10/15/AI%20RMF_RFI%20Summary%20Report.pdf" href="/document/summary-analysis-responses-nist-artificial-intelligence-risk-management-framework-ai-rmf" title="Summary Analysis of Responses to the NIST Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework (AI RMF) - Request for Information (RFI) National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST)">Brief summary</a>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<a href="/itl/ai-risk-management-framework/comments-received-rfi-artificial-intelligence-risk-management" title="Comments Received for RFI on Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="5891bf67-a87f-476b-bc47-22841e3c9f76" data-entity-substitution="canonical">responses</a> to the July 29, 2021, RFI (October 15, 2021)</li><li><a class="media-link-ga " data-entity-substitution="canonical" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="24325321-8e74-4dcf-b4a5-fdadee17f480" data-file-url="/system/files/documents/2021/10/15/taxonomy_AI_risks.pdf" href="/document/draft-taxonomy-ai-risk-october-15-2021" title="Draft -Taxonomy of AI Risk - October 15, 2021">Draft -Taxonomy of AI Risk</a>&nbsp;(October 15, 2021)</li><li><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2021/07/29/2021-16176/artificial-intelligence-risk-management-framework">AI Risk Management Framework Request for Information</a>&nbsp;(July 29, 2021)</li></ul><div class="nist-callout"><h2>Contact Us</h2><p><span class="spamspan"><span class="u">aiframework</span> [at] <span class="d">nist.gov</span><span class="t"> (aiframework[at]nist[dot]gov)</span></span>&nbsp;</p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    \n  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--tagged-content-list paragraph--view-mode--default">\n          \n            <div\n  class="nist-block "\n>\n  \n  <h2\n       class="nist-block__title"\n      >  News &amp; Updates\n</h2>\n      \n      <div class="views-element-container"><div class="js-view-dom-id-55afbe0565b56f3ed2ced2bafef2f19809cad6f67bdce9c53a700dd6345a2006">\n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n\n    <div>\n<article\n       about="/news-events/news/2023/01/nist-risk-management-framework-aims-improve-trustworthiness-artificial" typeof="schema:Article" class="nist-teaser"\n    >\n        <div class="nist-teaser__image">\n                                        <div class="entity-reference">  <a href="/news-events/news/2023/01/nist-risk-management-framework-aims-improve-trustworthiness-artificial" hreflang="en"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/images/2023/01/25/RMF-redesign-rounded-other_graphics-04.png?itok=q6XNzk9H" width="89" height="100" alt="Circular design includes elements of the AI Risk Management Framework: Govern, Measure, Manage, Map." typeof="foaf:Image" />\n\n</a>\n</div>\n            \n          </div>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content-wrapper">\n    <header>\n              <h3 class="nist-teaser__title"><a href="/news-events/news/2023/01/nist-risk-management-framework-aims-improve-trustworthiness-artificial"><span property="schema:name">NIST Risk Management Framework Aims to Improve Trustworthiness of Artificial Intelligence</span>\n</a></h3>\n                        <div class="nist-teaser__date">\n                            <div class="daterange"><time datetime="2023-01-26T12:00:00Z">January 26, 2023</time>\n</div>\n            \n      </div>\n                  \n    </header>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content">\n                          <div property="schema:text" class="text-with-summary">  New guidance seeks to cultivate trust in AI technologies and promote AI innovation while mitigating risk.\n\n</div>\n            \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n  <div>\n<article\n       about="/news-events/news/2022/08/nist-seeks-comments-ai-risk-management-framework-guidance-workshop-date-set" typeof="schema:Article" class="nist-teaser"\n    >\n        <div class="nist-teaser__image">\n                                        <div class="entity-reference">  <a href="/news-events/news/2022/08/nist-seeks-comments-ai-risk-management-framework-guidance-workshop-date-set" hreflang="en"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/images/2019/07/02/composite_hero.jpg?itok=GMAHx99X" width="100" height="36" alt="Illustration that shows an outline of a face and then icons to represent different areas of AI including heart (health), lock (cyber), windmills (energy), steering wheel (cars) and manufacturing arm" typeof="foaf:Image" />\n\n</a>\n</div>\n            \n          </div>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content-wrapper">\n    <header>\n              <h3 class="nist-teaser__title"><a href="/news-events/news/2022/08/nist-seeks-comments-ai-risk-management-framework-guidance-workshop-date-set"><span property="schema:name">NIST Seeks Comments on AI Risk Management Framework Guidance, Workshop Date Set</span>\n</a></h3>\n                        <div class="nist-teaser__date">\n                            <div class="daterange"><time datetime="2022-08-18T12:00:00Z">August 18, 2022</time>\n</div>\n            \n      </div>\n                  \n    </header>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content">\n                          <div property="schema:text" class="text-with-summary">  NIST is seeking comments on a second draft of the NIST Artificial Intelligence Risk Management Framework (AI RMF). The AI RMF is intended for voluntary use in...\n\n</div>\n            \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n  <div>\n<article\n       about="/news-events/news/2022/04/symposium-focuses-ai-and-economy-and-path-responsible-and-inclusive-ai" typeof="schema:Article" class="nist-teaser"\n    >\n        <div class="nist-teaser__image">\n                                        <div class="entity-reference">  <a href="/news-events/news/2022/04/symposium-focuses-ai-and-economy-and-path-responsible-and-inclusive-ai" hreflang="en"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/images/2022/04/27/AI%20Conf%20April%2027.png?itok=LeuJi_me" width="100" height="32" alt="AI Conference Header April 27, 2022" typeof="foaf:Image" />\n\n</a>\n</div>\n            \n          </div>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content-wrapper">\n    <header>\n              <h3 class="nist-teaser__title"><a href="/news-events/news/2022/04/symposium-focuses-ai-and-economy-and-path-responsible-and-inclusive-ai"><span property="schema:name">Symposium Focuses on AI and the Economy and the Path for Responsible and Inclusive AI</span>\n</a></h3>\n                        <div class="nist-teaser__date">\n                            <div class="daterange"><time datetime="2022-04-27T12:00:00Z">April 27, 2022</time>\n</div>\n            \n      </div>\n                  \n    </header>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content">\n                          <div property="schema:text" class="text-with-summary">  The U.S. Department of Commerce, NIST, FinRegLab, and the Stanford Institute for Human-Centered Artificial Intelligence (HAI) hosted a symposium on "Artificial...\n\n</div>\n            \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n  <div>\n<article\n       about="/news-events/news/2022/03/nist-seeks-comments-draft-ai-risk-management-framework-offers-guidance-ai" typeof="schema:Article" class="nist-teaser"\n    >\n        <div class="nist-teaser__image">\n                                        <div class="entity-reference">  <a href="/news-events/news/2022/03/nist-seeks-comments-draft-ai-risk-management-framework-offers-guidance-ai" hreflang="en"><img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/images/2020/11/23/CAMEO-ai_%28002%29.png?itok=98nqE-sp" width="100" height="100" alt="An illustration for AI shows a silhouette of a human head containing icons for computer networks. " typeof="foaf:Image" />\n\n</a>\n</div>\n            \n          </div>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content-wrapper">\n    <header>\n              <h3 class="nist-teaser__title"><a href="/news-events/news/2022/03/nist-seeks-comments-draft-ai-risk-management-framework-offers-guidance-ai"><span property="schema:name">NIST Seeks Comments on Draft AI Risk Management Framework, Offers Guidance on AI Bias</span>\n</a></h3>\n                        <div class="nist-teaser__date">\n                            <div class="daterange"><time datetime="2022-03-17T12:00:00Z">March 17, 2022</time>\n</div>\n            \n      </div>\n                  \n    </header>\n    <div class="nist-teaser__content">\n                          <div property="schema:text" class="text-with-summary">  Seeking to promote the development and use of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies and systems that are trustworthy and responsible, NIST today released...\n\n</div>\n            \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n\n    \n\n  \n  \n\n      <footer>\n      <div class="link-list"><a href="/news-events/news-updates/tag/2791391">View All News and Updates</a></div>\n    </footer>\n  \n  \n</div>\n</div>\n\n        \n  </div>\n      </div>\n\n\n        \n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n      \n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n        \n  \n    <div class="grid-container">\n\n    \n  </div>\n  \n</section>\n\n\n        \n  </div>\n\n\n  \n    \n<div class="nist-page-feedback__block">\n  <a\n    class="usa-button usa-button--outline webform-dialog webform-dialog-narrow nist-page-feedback__button"\n    href="/webform/page_feedback?page=https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework&page_title=AI Risk Management Framework&source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1674601"\n    data-dialog-options="{&quot;dialogClass&quot;:&quot;no-titlebar page-feedback&quot;}" rel="nofollow"\n  >\n    Was this page helpful?\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<div data-elastic-exclude>\n<!-- nist-index-ignore-start -->\n\n<footer class="nist-footer padding-bottom-4">\n\n  \n    <div class="grid-container nist-footer__info">\n      <div class="grid-row">\n        <div class="tablet:grid-col-6">\n          <div class="nist-footer__logo">\n            <a href="/" title="National Institute of Standards and Technology" rel="home">\n              <img class="nist-footer__logo-img" src="/libraries/nist-component-library/dist/img/logo/NIST-Logo-Brand-White.svg" alt="National Institute of Standards and Technology logo" width="300px" height="42px" />\n            </a>\n          </div>\n          <div class="nist-footer__contact">\n            <h3 class="nist-footer__contact-heading">HEADQUARTERS</h3>\n            <address>\n              100 Bureau Drive<br>\n              Gaithersburg, MD 20899<br>\n              <a href="tel:301-975-2000">301-975-2000</a>\n            </address>\n            <p>\n              <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#97f3f8bae0f2f5faf6e4e3f